# ERA Orchestrator — local development

**Inherits:** monorepo root `.cursor/rules/`. Ports: `docs/ECOSYSTEM_URLS.md`.

## Stack

- **API:** NestJS `apps/api` — port **4000** (`npm run start:dev -w @era365/api`)
- **Web:** Next.js `apps/web` — port **3000** (client control plane)
- **Platform Console:** Next.js `apps/platform-web` — port **3001** (`platform.era-365.online`)
- **DBs:** `packages/database` (control plane), `packages/mdm-database` (`era_mdm`)

## Commands (from `era-orchestrator/`)

| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `npm run dev` | API + Web + Platform Console concurrently |
| `npm run dev:platform` | Platform Console only (`:3001`) |
| `npm run db:generate` | Generate both Prisma clients |
| `npm run db:bootstrap-local` | Migrate control-plane + bootstrap platform admins |
| `npm run platform:backfill-org-profile` | CP-ORG-PROFILE-01: Finance→orch profile seed (dry-run; `-- --apply`; optional `-- --with-satellites`). Needs `FINANCE_DATABASE_URL`; `/files/` logos need `FINANCE_PUBLIC_URL`. |
| `npm run test:org-profile-backfill` | Unit tests for backfill helpers |
| `npm run test:api` | API Jest suite |

Migrations: `npm run db:migrate:deploy -w @era365/database` (and mdm-database when schema changes).

**Docker:** image already has generated Prisma clients. Entrypoint must not `prisma generate` / `npx prisma` (Nightly hang). Prisma CLI is hoisted to `/app/node_modules`. `SKIP_PRISMA_MIGRATE=1` after `migrate-all.sh`. Compose: orchestrator depends on Postgres + Redis only — not finance-core.

## Env (typical)

`JWT_SECRET`, `DATABASE_URL`, `MDM_DATABASE_URL`, `REDIS_URL`, `SATELLITE_EVENT_SERVICE_TOKEN`, `ERA_SSO_SHARED_SECRET`, `PII_ENCRYPTION_KEY`, `PII_BLIND_INDEX_KEY`.

**Platform catalog gateway (orchestrator → data-hub):** `ERA_DATA_HUB_URL` (e.g. `http://127.0.0.1:4200`), `DATA_HUB_SERVICE_TOKEN`, `REFERENCE_DATA_SKIP_ENTITLEMENT=1` for local dev without entitlement rows.

**Workforce policy (satellites → orchestrator):** industry apps call `GET /platform/v1/workforce/policy` via `@era/satellite-kit` `fetchWorkforcePolicy` (no Finance URL).

## i18n

Orchestrator web: `apps/web/messages/{az,ru,en}.json` (next-intl). Not the finance three-channel i18n pipeline.
